      <h1>Started by farmers, for farmers</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Nyajena Agricultural Group was founded by Zimbabwean farmers who needed a supplier they
        could rely on for poultry and small livestock.
      </p>
      <p>
        We began as a single hatchery distribution route. Since {{ site.founded }} we have grown
        into a supplier that delivers healthy stock, practical advice and access to buyers for
        farmers of every size, from peri-urban plots and communal lands to commercial estates.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our team includes vets, farm business advisers and people who have raised stock for
        years. We run our home farm at {{ site.address.street }}, {{ site.address.locality }}, where
        you can also collect your order.
      </p>
    </div>
